  "purpose": "ot_hgi_qdq_q B2 quarter cluster via ref_tile: track-B decoder (dxl/dbq/daq hard tiles, CLOSED views) + 4 lane-pair response-FIFO leaf tiles (qdq_lq_ref, M5) + result FIFO on one 64x512 SRAM macro (2-entry registered prefetch; was a 64x512 flop array read 64:1), W face = slice read lanes, N face = slice write lanes, S = dispatch rec/ret, clock spine; span product split into 4-bit partials/pair/sum/product/end (+5 ingress edges), reset only lane valid, unconditional decode capture",
  "extra_paths": [
